  "description": "A lightweight, web-based implementation of an agentic framework for Industry 5.0. It enables Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) decision making at the Edge, integrating Large Language Models for explainable data curation and one-click recalibration of Edge AI models over MQTT telemetry. Official implementation of the PRO-VE 2025 Best Paper Award-winning framework.",
